meta {
  name: Get My Profile
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/employees
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access-token}}
}

docs {
  # Get My Profile
  
  Obtiene los datos del usuario autenticado.
  
  ## Headers requeridos
  - Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
  
  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "MsgUserFound",
    "data": {
      "id": "obfuscated_id",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "email": "john@example.com",
      "role": "PILOT",
      ...
    }
  }
  ```
}
